# Local credentials. `.envrc` loads these when present; they must never be committed.
# A committed `.env` of placeholders is worse than none: direnv loads it, so every developer
# gets `UV_INDEX_EQTY_USERNAME="your-username"` injected and a 401 from the private index.
.env
.secrets
graphify-out/
